  AVPA_Read_SweepMode

      ViStatus AVPA_Read_SweepMode (ViSession instrumentHandle,
                                    ViInt16 *sweepModeStatus, ViChar sweepMode[]);

  Purpose

      This function returns the Sweep Mode and says whether the sweep is
      performed in the full screen or only in the Measurement Window.
      
      

  Parameter List

      instrumentHandle

          Variable Type       ViSession

          This control accepts the Instrument Handle returned by the Initialize
          function to select the desired instrument driver session.
          
          Default Value:  None

      sweepModeStatus

          Variable Type       ViInt16 (passed by reference)

          returns the Sweep Mode status.
          
          Valid Range :
          0 - Normal & full
          20 - Single & full
          1 - Normal & window
          21 - Single & window
          
          Notes :
          (1) Normal - Continuous sweep
          (2) Single - single sweep
          (3) Full - measurement window inactive
          (4) Window - measurement window active
          

      sweepMode

          Variable Type       ViChar[]

          returns the Sweep Mode and says whether the sweep is performed in the
          full screen or only in the Measurement Window.
          
          Valid Range :
          Normal & full
          Single & full
          Normal & window
          Single & window
          
          Notes :
          (1) Normal - Continuous sweep
          (2) Single - single sweep
          (3) Full - measurement window inactive
          (4) Window - measurement window active
          

