                                  ViReal64 ratioRBWto1Span);

  Purpose

      This function is used to set up the ratio between RBW and the span. This
      ratio is used to estimate the appropriate setting for RBW when RBW->AUTO
      is selected (cf function "Set RBW").

  Parameter List

      instrumentHandle

          Variable Type       ViSession

          This control accepts the Instrument Handle returned by the Initialize
          function to select the desired instrument driver session.
          
          Default Value:  None

