          Enables manual setting of the ratio RBW to Span. Resets the RBW /
          Span coupling to its default setting.
          
          
          Valid Range:
          VI_OFF - Manual
          VI_ON - Default (Default Value)
          
          Note : Field "Ratio" is only valid when "Manual" is selected.

      ratioRBWto1Span

